    pros: [
      "Named best for small dogs in Whole Dog Journal’s January 2026 comparison",
      "A safety key, an emergency stop button and a remote, per the listing",
      "Quiet, according to the maker and to reviewers",
      "Less than half the price of the GoPet PR720F it replaces here",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Marketed for dogs up to 130 lb; Whole Dog Journal says it suits dogs under about 25 to 30 lb",
      "Deck length and top speed differ between sources, so they are not on the card",
      "The listing points to a leash and crossbar setup in the manual; never tether a dog to it",
    ],
    bottomLine: "For a small dog with a short stride, under about 25 lb, whose owner wants a quiet machine with a remote and an emergency stop from Amazon.",
    description: "The GoPet PetRun PR720F, our earlier small-to-medium pick, is sold through specialist dealers rather than on Amazon, so this card shows the PawRunner, Lifepro’s motorised pet treadmill, which Amazon does sell. Whole Dog Journal’s January 2026 comparison names it the best choice for small dogs, with a caveat we agree with: Lifepro markets it for dogs up to 130 lb, which WDJ calls a little misleading, judging it suitable for dogs under about 25 to 30 lb with short strides. The sources disagree on the deck. The Amazon listing gives a 38.6 by 14.2-inch running surface and 0.5 to 7.5 mph; WDJ gives a 42-inch deck; and Target’s listing, checked for our small-dog guide, gave speeds up to 12 mph. So the card carries features rather than numbers. That deck is shorter than the PR720F’s 52 inches, so this is a machine for small dogs, not medium ones, whatever the listing says. The listing also says to review the manual’s leash and crossbar setup; our rule, below, is that a dog should never be tied to a treadmill. Lifepro Fitness’s one CPSC recall, of infrared sauna blankets in 2025, does not concern this machine. Amazon listed it at $331.33 on 9 November 2026.",
  },
  {
    id: "xoiasth-large-dog-treadmill",
    name: "Xoiasth Dog Treadmill for Large and Medium Dogs",
    brand: "Xoiasth",
    category: "Motorised large-dog treadmill on Amazon (in place of the Dog Runner Revolution Pro)",
    badge: "Closest on Amazon",
    amazonUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H393LRLQ?tag=sktiger-20&linkCode=ll1",
